cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Franko TEI software, please cite this repository.
  Cite Ivan Franko's printed edition and the source scans separately.
title: "Franko TEI"
type: software
abstract: >-
  In-progress research software for source-checked diplomatic transcription of
  Ivan Franko's five-volume Апокріфи і лєґенди з українських рукописів
  (1896–1910). Intended outputs are TEI XML and Text-Fabric; no complete
  verified corpus has been released.
authors:
  - family-names: Sosnovshchenko
    given-names: Oleksandr
repository-code: https://github.com/alexsosn/franko-tei
license: MIT
